  Steps to send stuff to terminal // or just take things 

  to access the terminal click the three dots near the top left! 

  git add . 
  git commit . -m "put your update reasoning here!"
  git fetch 
  git rebase 
  git push 

  tada!! ! 

  if you don't want to send stuff and just want to update; use 
  git pull; <<<<<